# *BUG LIFECYCLE:(BLC)*



NEW ---->ASSIGN(-->reject,-->hold,-->as per design)---->OPEN(-->duplicate,-->deffered)---->FIXED---->RE-TESTING(-->pass-->close, -->fail-->re-open-->ASSIGN)





-Bug number



**-duplicate:** when two or more people get the same type of bug but report it as diff bug numbers(repeated)

**-deffered:** not an important bug(not priority)













